  m_Name: why_bother
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: 
  playerChoiceText: why do you even bother
  lines:
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: " Because someone has to. We can\u2019t just sit and wait forever."
  - speaker: Player
    text: " But it\u2019s exhausting, isn\u2019t it?"
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: Of course, you should join plus your focus is shot. I need someone to dedicate
      a full day to tutoring our students.
  - speaker: Player
    text: "A full day\u2026 without money? This is tough."
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: They need your attention, and you need a reminder of purpose and yes it
      t will take effort, but your stress will drop immensely
  - speaker: Player
    text: "But I can\u2019t keep falling apart mentally.Helping them might remind
      me why I keep trying"
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: 'Your time is valuable, but so is your peace of mind.


      Will you
      help these children today?'
  unlockTask: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5ed94a7ef1da00429084aabd851c3d2, type: 2}
